          "number": 3,
          "letter": "C",
          "english": "It might be tempting to cross something off your to-do list while on a phone interview, but recruiters and hiring managers can easily tell if your attention is elsewhere. Many interviewers are annoyed to see people who decide to multitask while on the phone interview. There are candidates who wash dishes, go for walks, or do grocery shopping during the interview. Needless to say, this doesn't reflect well on your level of interest in the position you're interviewing for.",
          "chinese": "在电话面试时，你可能会想顺便完成待办事项中的某一项，但招聘人员和招聘经理很容易看出你的注意力是否放在别处。许多面试官都对那些决定在电话面试期间一心多用的人感到恼火。有些候选人会在面试时洗碗、散步或买菜。不用说，这并不能很好地体现你对所应聘职位的兴趣程度。",
